{"applicability_conditions":"用于 DIM 相的强度计算；正文指出对 B/TM、FM、DIM 三相，C 原子对其强度的贡献非常显著，采用此类分解计算。","identity":{"block_id":"b0075","equation_id":"equation_008","equation_number":"8","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma_ {\\mathrm{DIM}} = \\Delta \\sigma_ {\\mathrm{DIM}} ^ {\\mathrm{C}} + \\sigma_ {\\mathrm{DIM}} ^ {\\mathrm{p}} + \\sigma_ {\\mathrm{DIM}} ^ {\\mathrm{dis}}\\tag{8}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.cja.2025.103802"},"latex":"\\sigma_{\\mathrm{DIM}} = \\Delta \\sigma_{\\mathrm{DIM}}^{\\mathrm{C}} + \\sigma_{\\mathrm{DIM}}^{\\mathrm{p}} + \\sigma_{\\mathrm{DIM}}^{\\mathrm{dis}}","purpose":"该公式用于计算 DIM 相的总强度：将其分解为 C 原子固溶强化贡献（Δσ_DIM^C）、p 项（σ_DIM^p）与 dis 项（σ_DIM^dis）三者之和。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"DIM 相的总强度","symbol":"σ_DIM","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"C 原子对 DIM 相固溶强化的贡献","symbol":"Δσ_DIM^C","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":null,"symbol":"σ_DIM^p","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":null,"symbol":"σ_DIM^dis","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["上下文中仅明确解释了 Δσ_j^C（C 原子对固溶强化的贡献，b0076），未给出上标 p 和 dis 的具体含义。","该公式与式(6)（B/TM 相）、式(7)（FM 相）形式相同，分别用于不同相的强度分解计算。"]}